  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "The last 1.x feature release. ⚠ A bare RichEditor now shows every document continuous: set ViewMode = Page to draw pages (RichEditorView does). Line spacing follows HWP (160% of the font size by default). Requires Avalonia 12.1 or later. Full notes and the other behaviour changes: https://github.com/centwon/AvaloniaRichEditor/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
